        /// <item><description>"1": SDL will send a quit event when the last window is requesting to close. (default)</description></item>
        /// </list>
        /// <para>If there is at least one active system tray icon, <see cref="CSDL.EventType.Quit">Quit</see> will instead be sent when both the last window will be closed and the last tray icon will be destroyed.</para>
