        /// <item><description>"1": Use the driver point API using Bresenham's line algorithm (correct, draws many points)</description></item>
        /// <item><description>"2": Use the driver line API (occasionally misses line endpoints based on hardware driver quirks</description></item>
        /// <item><description>"3": Use the driver geometry API (correct, draws thicker diagonal lines)</description></item>
        /// </list>
        /// <para>This hint should be set before creating a renderer.</para>
        /// </remarks>
        /// <since>This hint is available since SDL 3.2.0</since>
